OL,3,GNEWSABus crashes into city centre
OL,4,Aleisure complex
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bus has crashed into a leisure
OL,7,Fcomplex in Leeds city centre.
OL,9,FPolice were called to reports that a
OL,10,Fbus had mounted the kerb and collided
OL,11,Fwith a building on The Headrow at about
OL,12,F16:35 GMT.
OL,14,FPolice and paramedics remain at the
OL,15,Fscene outside The Light, with Albion
OL,16,FStreet cordoned off to traffic and
OL,17,Fpedestrians.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
