OL,3,GNEWSABus crashes into city centre
OL,4,Aleisure complex
OL,5,
OL,6,FParamedics have been seen tending to
OL,7,Fpeople on chairs outside the nearby
OL,8,FTurtle Bay restaurant, but police said
OL,9,F"no serious injuries" had been
OL,10,Freported.
